#. Rose's handwriting. Keep the blank lines between paragraphs. Never say she
#. is Delilah's mother: in these letters she is only Rose.
#: letters_demo.json[1]
msgctxt "letter"
msgid ""
"Receiving this from you made my whole day. The house feels far too quiet without you. I miss you dearly.\n"
"\n"
"Even so, my heart is bursting with pride. It takes so much courage to chase your dreams out in the world."
msgstr ""

