#: letters_demo.json[2]
msgctxt "letter"
msgid ""
"Gardening just isn't the same without you. Every time I walk through the garden, I feel like I will find you in a corner, digging around for hidden treasures.\n"
"\n"
"I've been trying to plan a special surprise for you, but all of this is so new to me. I know seeds and plants, but geology is very different. Still, I'm determined to learn so I can share in your world."
msgstr ""

