msgid ""
"Today I found something wonderful. Ever since I started collecting rocks, rocks have been rolling across my counters, floors, and even sometimes out the door.\n"
"\n"
"I realized your collection needed a proper home, so I bought a cozy, quiet place out in the woods with plenty of room for all your treasures.\n"
